  "requirements_html": "<p><strong>License key needed.</strong> Paste your key here the first time you use a private Farmer. Don't have a key yet? Ask us for a free one. Once it works, we'll remember it securely on this Windows account.</p><p>You'll need an internet connection whenever Indura Farmer starts. Each key can only be used on the first computer it activates.</p><p><strong>Human team:</strong> Pick any three of SJW, Ban, Sho, Roxy, or Freyr. Mikasa is the preferred fourth unit.</p>",
